## Control {{controlId}}: Provide Audit Record Reduction and Report Generation to Support On-Demand Analysis

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization provides audit record reduction and report generation within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant to support on-demand analysis of security events, managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if auditQueriesConfigured}}
**Automated Reduction and Reporting:**
Microsoft Sentinel provides audit record reduction through saved queries and workbooks:
{{#if queries}}
{{#each queries}}
- **{{name}}**{{#if description}} — {{description}}{{/if}} — Source: {{dataSource}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

KQL (Kusto Query Language) queries filter, aggregate, and summarize large volumes of audit data. Pre-built workbooks provide executive and technical reports on demand.
{{/if}}

{{#if sentinelNotAvailable}}
**Manual Reduction and Reporting:**
Microsoft Sentinel is not deployed. Audit record reduction uses native M365 capabilities:

**Available Reduction Tools:**
- **Entra ID Sign-In Reports:** Filtered views by user, application, status, location, and date range
- **Directory Audit Filters:** Filtered by activity type, actor, target resource, and date range
- **Unified Audit Log Search:** Cross-service search with export to CSV for offline analysis
- **Microsoft Defender Reports:** Pre-built security reports with filtering and export capabilities

**Operational Procedure:**
- **Action:** Generate monthly audit summary reports from M365 admin center; perform ad-hoc audit searches for investigations
- **Frequency:** Monthly summary reports; on-demand for incident investigation
- **Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}
- **Documentation:** Audit Reporting Procedure AU-006
{{/if}}

**Review Frequency:** Monthly report review by ISSO

**Verification Method:** Examine audit report generation capabilities, saved query configurations, monthly summary reports, and ad-hoc investigation records.

